  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "John the Baptist Prepares the Way",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days John the Baptist came, preaching in the wilderness of Judea",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and saying, \"Repent, for the kingdom of heaven has come near.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is he who was spoken of through the prophet Isaiah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 3:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"A voice of one calling in the wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 3:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'Prepare the way for the Lord,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 3:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "make straight paths for him.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "John's clothes were made of camel's hair, and he had a leather belt around his waist. His food was locusts and wild honey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "People went out to him from Jerusalem and all Judea and the whole region of the Jordan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Confessing their sins, they were baptized by him in the Jordan River.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when he saw many of the Pharisees and Sadducees coming to where he was baptizing, he said to them: \"You brood of vipers! Who warned you to flee from the coming wrath?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Produce fruit in keeping with repentance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And do not think you can say to yourselves, 'We have Abraham as our father.' I tell you that out of these stones God can raise up children for Abraham.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ax is already at the root of the trees, and every tree that does not produce good fruit will be cut down and thrown into the fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I baptize you with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "water for repentance. But after me comes one who is more powerful than I, whose sandals I am not worthy to carry. He will baptize you with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the Holy Spirit and fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His winnowing fork is in his hand, and he will clear his threshing floor, gathering his wheat into the barn and burning up the chaff with unquenchable fire.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Baptism of Jesus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus came from Galilee to the Jordan to be baptized by John.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But John tried to deter him, saying, \"I need to be baptized by you, and do you come to me?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus replied,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Let it be so now; it is proper for us to do this to fulfill all righteousness.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then John consented.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As soon as Jesus was baptized, he went up out of the water. At that moment heaven was opened, and he saw the Spirit of God descending like a dove and alighting on him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And a voice from heaven said, \"This is my Son, whom I love; with him I am well pleased.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "MAT.4",
    "number": "4",
    "bookId": "MAT"
  },
